WEBVTT

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.690
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:23.370
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.500
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.550
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.640
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.560
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.690
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.900
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.160
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.580
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:12.340
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.590
I trust you forever

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:25.220
Now, everybody...

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:28.310
It's almost time
to say goodbye.

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:32.610
I no longer have anything
left to explain here.

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:36.610
Yes. This is the
last Gundam Fight.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:38.990
So, join me in saying...

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:42.580
Ready! Go!

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:48.670
God Gundam's Great Triumph!
A Hopeful Future... Ready! Go!

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.170
Wait for me, Rain!

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.670
I'll be there!

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:01.220
I'll be there!

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:05.220
Wh-what's that?

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:08.640
Self-recovering?

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:10.690
Th-that's crazy.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:12.360
Even after being turned
into a pile of scrap?!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.110
The monster!

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.750
Wh-what's happening now?!

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:41.510
The Earth!

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.200
Domon! We have a situation!

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:46.060
The generator's self-recovering.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:48.060
What'd you say?!

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:50.520
Your friends have resumed fighting.

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:56.190
It looks like the Devil
Gundam has acquired powers...

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:58.070
...far beyond anything
we had imagined.

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.360
I understand, Dad.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:04.950
I promise I'll save Rain and
put an end to the Devil Gundam!

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:14.210
No!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.170
Please distract it.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:19.550
So it will let up its attack on Domon.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:21.630
Roger!

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.380
All units, stand by to attack!

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:24.760
Understood!

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.970
Leave this to us!

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:29.640
Neo France will handle port side!

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:31.930
I'll adjust the scope!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.100
Z uisen Beam!

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.150
Keiun Laser!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.070
Fire!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.630
Enemy approaching from behind!

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.720
Gundam Heads closing in!

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.090
Crash-back!

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:06.800
It's no use! We won't make it!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:20.020
Leave these guys to us!

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:21.650
Go and help Domon!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.360
Miss Allenby, Mr. Kyral!

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.110
Thank you!

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:26.570
It's nothing.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:30.030
Gundam Federation
First Unit, follow me!

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:35.040
Don't let even one of the Devil
Gundam's legs get close to Earth!

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:43.910
All units, prepare to attack!

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.130
Maximum output!

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.760
Here we go!

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.010
Kyral Reaper!

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.390
Mandala Circle!

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.520
Rest in peace!

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:14.660
Namuamidabutsu!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.130
Now what do you
think of our power?!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.500
Wh-what?!

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:28.430
Kyral!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:39.400
Is that monstrous Devil Gundam
trying to swallow the Earth?

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:42.520
Warning to all nations!
Earth is in danger!

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:09.010
Grandpa!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.220
It's okay!

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:12.760
Domon and the others
will save Earth!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.430
Yes, have faith in them!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.350
Put your faith in our Gundams!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.110
Machinegun...

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.400
...Punch!

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.240
Shin Ryusei Kochoken!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:31.950
Rose Hurricane!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.530
Graviton Hammer!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.540
We did it!

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:51.300
Damn! We're just
wasting our time!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:56.350
Domon!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.100
What's up with Domon?

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:58.560
Hurry!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.270
We can't hold on much longer!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.650
Nether Gundam Formation here!

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.320
Mark 3, Mark 5, Mark 9,
badly damaged!

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.570
We'll let Mark 13 lead the...

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.330
Stern and port sections
have been hit!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.200
The Devil Gundam?!

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.330
Hard to starboard!
Avoid it!

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:29.210
Gundam!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.430
Domon. You're okay.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:45.190
I will fight with this
hand of mine burning red!

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:46.190
So, everyone...

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:49.530
Hold on a bit longer!

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:54.030
God... Finger!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.810
This is the core.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:13.760
Rain...

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.510
Where are you, Rain?!

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.410
Wh-what the...?!

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:58.470
Dr. Kasshu! What
is that Gundam?!

00:08:58.470 --> 00:08:59.850
It can't be...

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.810
I can't believe it.

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:05.770
But if this is the Devil
Gundam's final form...

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.560
...we are all in grave trouble.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.030
This is crazy!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.280
Why would it use weapons
within its own body?!

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:21.330
It's suicidal!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:27.040
Then, before I find Rain...

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:31.090
Erupting...

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:37.880
...God... Finger!

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:40.470
Rain!

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:41.600
No way!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.770
Th-that was Rain.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.500
R-Rain...

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:15.170
R-Rain... Why?

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:29.100
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:33.310
Rain...

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.030
What's going on?

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.190
What're you doing up there?

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.780
I-I get it.

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:41.990
You can't break out on your own.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:43.530
Then I'll just...

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:46.740
...crush this thing!

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:47.950
Stop it, Domon!

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:53.330
Wh-why, Dad?!

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:54.750
Look carefully!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.170
That Gundam is Rain herself.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.550
Think about it.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:03.430
The closer you get to Rain,
the more fierce its attack...

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.930
...and the faster its development.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.220
But why?

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:09.930
Listen to me, Domon.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:14.150
Rain is trying to
keep away from you!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.110
What do you mean?

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.730
My father has made you suffer.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:21.500
And Father's crimes are,
in turn, my crimes.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.240
I'm sorry, Domon.

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:25.950
I shall never see you again.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:28.450
This is crazy!

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:33.000
I'm sorry, Rain!

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:34.330
Are you okay?

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:36.670
No! Don't come any closer!

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.890
Wh-why not?!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:45.390
You should see by now.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:48.350
This Gundam has reached
its ultimate form...

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:52.100
...using human emotions and
mental processes for its energy.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.770
And it has now
become Rain herself.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.650
H-how can this be?

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:03.430
I've come this far, and
my final enemy is...

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:04.740
...Rain?

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.330
How could it be?

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.580
There's no way I can win.

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:17.700
There's just no way I can win.

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:24.590
You mustn't give up!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.220
Why can' t you understand
Rain's feelings?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.600
Think.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:35.940
Her own father's caused a lot of
misery to the person she loves.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:37.980
Deep inside Rain's heart...

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.540
...is the guilt of this
crime against you.

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:44.570
She's closed her heart
to you with that Gundam.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:46.110
So...

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:52.790
I'll teach you a foolproof spell...

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:55.040
...that's guaranteed to open
the door to Rain's heart.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.000
All you say is, "I love you."

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:00.750
Tell me.

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.310
Have you ever once
said that to Rain?

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:10.100
All you have to do is be
true to your own feelings.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.060
But I...

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.430
Then that's easy.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.110
Just say those words to her.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.070
Yes.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.610
There's no need to be shy.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.860
Now's the time for your emotions.

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.570
Tell her how you feel!

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.010
Come on!

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:37.790
Or else I'll never be able to fall
in love with anyone other than you.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.460
Allenby...

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.720
Stop being such a pest!

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:56.350
Now, hurry!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:58.140
Thank you.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.480
Rain!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.920
It stopped.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.290
The attack...

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.500
...stopped.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:23.770
This is where it counts.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.010
Rain...

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.560
Can you hear me, Rain?

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.660
You don't need to answer me.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.650
I just want you to listen.

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:48.610
Dr. Mikamura is gone now.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:56.740
His last words were,
"Everything's my fault."

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.030
But none of that matters to me now!

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:03.080
It doesn't matter.

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:08.920
Did you think I'd blame you
for what happened to me?

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:12.690
Hey...

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:17.220
What did we do together
this past year?

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:21.100
What was this past year all about?

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.350
We haven't even figured that out.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:30.780
You remember?

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:33.490
That time...

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:37.990
...when we were reunited after
ten years at my mom's grave...

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:41.620
...the higher-ups had decided to
force us into the Gundam Fight.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:45.420
And before we knew it, we were
thrown into the ring on Earth.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.550
I fought with everything I had!

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:50.630
But once the battle was over...

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:53.970
...those higher-ups thought of
nothing but their own interests.

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:56.250
But that's no reason...

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.480
...for our time together
to end like this.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.810
It's true. I did win
the Gundam Fight.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:09.480
But I won only because you
were always by my side.

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:11.530
That's right.

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:14.400
This victory was achieved
by the two of us, Rain.

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:16.200
And that's why...

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:19.090
...it wouldn't make any sense
if we didn't stay together.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:24.170
Look!

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:32.250
Hey, Rain.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.220
Remember on the morning
of the Finals...

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.050
...I said that if I won...

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:40.140
...there's something I
wanted to talk to you about?

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:45.270
I am a clumsy guy who
knows only how to fight.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.980
So this is the only way I can tell you.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.320
I want to...

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:51.820
...say that...

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.470
I want to say that...

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.240
...I love you!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:01.410
I want you!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:03.750
Rain!

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.170
Domon!

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.130
Rain!

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.140
Domon!

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:19.100
Rain!

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:20.010
Domon...

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.640
I'm so sorry.

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:23.770
I'll never leave you again!

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.390
I'll never let you go.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:28.480
We'll remain together forever.

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:35.320
Okay!

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.820
Let's finish him off.

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:37.740
Right.

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:41.030
These hands of ours
are burning red!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.370
Their loud cries tell us...

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.000
...to grasp happiness!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.710
Erupting...

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.550
...God... Finger!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:54.300
Seki!

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:54.920
Ha!

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:57.470
Love! Love!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:01.390
Tenkyoken!

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:21.120
Now...

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:22.780
...our true journey begins.

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:49.440
Domon Kasshu!

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.380
Fuun Saiki!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:06.960
Let's go!

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:17.990
Look!

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:18.800
Look at Earth!

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.270
The citizens are safe!

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:04.590
It looks like the quest for
supremacy over space...

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:05.970
...has vanished altogether.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.720
Let me ask you, Dr. Kasshu.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.410
What will become of the
Gundam Fight from now on?

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.910
I imagine it will continue.

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:18.610
Huh?

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:23.240
It's clear that there are problems
surrounding the Gundam Fight.

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:26.410
However, as long as we know that...

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:28.890
...it should be possible to fix them.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:32.040
After all, we humans are a race...

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.370
...that cannot seem to
live without fighting.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.880
Fighting for the hopes
of the future...

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.630
...as those youngsters
have shown us.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.970
Neo America
Chibodee Crocket

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:52.130
Chibodee!

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:54.310
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:57.190
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:57.270
Neo France George de Sand

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:00.650
I resume my forward journey

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:03.320
I resume my forward journey

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:04.700
Neo China Sai Saici

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.950
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.490
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:11.080
Neo Russia Argo Gulskii

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:11.700
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:14.580
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:20.880
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:25.470
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:29.930
Let's reach out with your hand

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.770
I'm sure friends will be there

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:37.270
Watching over you

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:40.020
Don't give up our tomorrow

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:40.860
And never turn back to yesterday

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:41.860
Hey, Rain.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:41.860
And never turn back to yesterday

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.150
And never turn back to yesterday

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.150
Let's go home.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:43.320
And never turn back to yesterday

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:44.400
To Earth, the home loved by
Kyoji, Schwarz and Master!

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:44.400
And never turn back to yesterday

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.700
Since we are not alone

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.700
To Earth, the home loved by
Kyoji, Schwarz and Master!

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.570
Let's swear to each other

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:49.530
Let's swear to each other

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:49.530
<i>Yes!</i>

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:52.200
Let's swear to each other

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.250
That even when times change

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.250
Gundam Fight!

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.290
That even when times change

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.290
Ready!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:58.290
I will never forget you

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:58.290
Go!

00:21:58.290 --> 00:21:59.830
I will never forget you

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:03.500
I trust you forever

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:09.390
Goodbye, everybody.

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:15.770
We will see you again at the
14th Gundam Fight Tournament.

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:27.860
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:30.370
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:35.660
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:38.210
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:43.340
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:47.010
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:53.970 --> 00:23:01.270
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:05.820
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:09.400
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:16.870
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.710
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you
